{
  "uid": "poc-traces",
  "title": "5 · Traces and logs",
  "description": "The demo service's requests, from trace to logs and back.",
  "tags": [
    "logging-poc"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "logging-poc"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "title": "Dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": 1,
          "label": "cluster",
          "stream": "",
          "refId": "cluster"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(cluster)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "demo-checkout",
        "current": {
          "text": "demo-checkout",
          "value": "demo-checkout"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The demo service handles a fake order every two seconds: a `checkout` span with `db.query` and `payment` inside it. About one payment in ten is declined. Each step also writes a log line with its `trace_id`.\n\n**Logs to trace:** in *Demo service logs*, click a line, then the **TraceID** link. **Trace to logs:** click a trace ID in the tables, then a span's log icon. Your own services: send OTLP to `otel-collector.observability:4317` and print `trace_id=<id>` in log lines."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Orders",
      "description": "Orders the demo service handled (from its logs).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"order received\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Declined payments",
      "description": "Payments that failed; their traces carry status=error.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"payment declined\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Decline rate",
      "description": "Declined payments as a share of orders.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"payment declined\" [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"order received\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.15
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Orders and declined payments",
      "description": "Per interval, from the demo service's logs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"order received\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "orders",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"} |= \"payment declined\" [$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "declined",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Total",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Latest traces",
      "description": "Newest traces of the service. Click a trace ID to open it.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Failed traces",
      "description": "Traces with a span in error: the declined payments.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && status=error}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Demo service logs",
      "description": "Click a line, then the TraceID link next to trace_id, to open its trace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{cluster=\"$cluster\", namespace=\"demo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      }
    }
  ]
}
